nebula changelog

1.1.1 (2026-08-24)
  - Added an EDEP fix to remove the problem of double counting SE energy. The edep function now outputs: 0 for SE generating inelastic events, energy loss omega for non SE generating inelastic events, and NaN for elastic, quasi elastic or boundary crossing events.
  - Changed the transition energy between phonon and Mott scattering to 15 eV inside the sample.

1.1.0 (2026-08-10)
  - Separated phonon scattering and elastic scattering channels.
    - Created an artificial transition between the two at 100 eV
  - Fixed q values in full_penn not being read using the right scale.

1.0.3 (WIP)
  - (No real code change) Drop support for C++11 and CUDA <9.2; add support for modern versions of CUDA.

1.0.2 (2021-05-26)
  - Fix bug where only partial simulations were done when a low number of primaries are provided (GPU version).

1.0.1 (2021-02-16)
  - Add support for Windows (thanks Alexander Skorikov)
  - Support CUDA Toolkit 11 (thanks Alexander Skorikov)
  - Add upper energy bound to simulations

1.0.0 (2020-06-02)
  - Initial release
